>> a := Into okusha.
>> b := Into okusha.
>> c := a.
Okuphumayo bhala: a ikheli-lenkumbulo izinhlamvu ? 0, umugqa-omusha.
Okuphumayo bhala: a ikheli-lenkumbulo izinhlamvu ? 1, umugqa-omusha.
Okuphumayo bhala: a ikheli-lenkumbulo = b ikheli-lenkumbulo, umugqa-omusha.
Okuphumayo bhala: a ikheli-lenkumbulo = c ikheli-lenkumbulo, umugqa-omusha.
